  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.14: PDF table-layout fix. #48: wide tables no longer render overlapping columns. Column widths are floored at the width each column's widest unbreakable word needs — a starved column borrows the shortfall from columns with slack (tables that already fit are unchanged); when even the minimum widths exceed the page, the whole table's font is scaled down just enough that no word is wider than its column. See CHANGELOG.md.",
